cases
requirement	case	module	access program	error	reason	output	diagnostic	assertion
ods.1	1	conversion	sheets					each table is one sheet named as the table, each cell's text its value, each type left behind named by its cell's A1 reference and attribute
ods.2	1	conversion	sheets	failed	cannot be represented			a cell's text MTSV cannot hold ends the load as cannot be represented, the conversion failed
ods.3	1	conversion	sheets	failed	failed			a spreadsheet document whose nodes hold no part content.xml ends the load as failed, the conversion failed
